.TH HARNESS 1 "September 2026" "agent-harness 0.2.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
harness \- performance layer for coding agents
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B harness
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Skills, instincts, memory, security and research-first that works the same
in Claude Code, Codex, Opencode, Cursor, Kiro CLI and Kiro.
.PP
Run \fBharness init\fR in your project, then \fBharness doctor\fR to verify.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B init [--harness <name>] [--auto] [--migrate] [--dry-run] [--force]
Set up harness in current project (preview or overwrite with the last two).
.TP
.B doctor [--fix] [--strict] [--json]
Check adapters, skills, security.
.TP
.B status
Project snapshot: memory, skills, hooks, last benchmark.
.TP
.B bench [--compare] [--quick]
Measure costs, save baseline.
.TP
.B optimize
Prune memory, repair, report savings.
.TP
.B optimizations [enable|disable] [name|all]
List, toggle optimizations.
.TP
.B map
Index repo to .harness/MAP.md.
.TP
.B skill <list|search|info|add|remove|verify|lint|update> ...
List, search, show, fetch, check, refresh skills.
.TP
.B memory <show|prune|sync|edit|stats|search|backup> [note]
Show, prune, append, edit, inspect MEMORY.md.
.TP
.B instinct <list|enable|disable|test> [name]
List, toggle, run hooks.
.TP
.B research [query|search|remove] ...
List findings, capture a stub, find or drop findings.
.TP
.B security <audit|scan> [--staged]
Run the audit script.
.TP
.B adapter <list|add|remove> [name]
List, scaffold, drop harnesses.
.TP
.B adapter list
List supported harnesses.
.TP
.B upgrade [--check]
Self-update to latest (check only with --check).
